              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefuta aramubwira ati: “Nugende.” Aramureka aragenda amarayo amezi abiri. We na bagenzi biwe baduga mu mitumba bararira kuko azopfa atarongowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
